1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,490
One thing in this picture costs you a whole day in Japan.

2
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:09,860
One. Your suitcase. The hotel desk sends it to your next hotel.

3
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:15,010
Two. Your bank card. Bank machines refuse it. Use a seven eleven.

4
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:21,710
Three. The last train. Nothing runs till five, and taxis add twenty percent after ten.

5
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:24,680
Save this for your Japan trip.
